<title>USA: Champion Enterprises Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Champion Enterprises Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>AUBURN HILLS, Mich. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			$  0.34		  $  0.28</p>
<p> Net			 16,924		   14,112</p>
<p> Revs		     425,570		  355,595</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  49,404		   50,157</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 net excludes non-recurring after tax charges of $16.7 million or $0.34 a share related to October 1996 merger with Redman Industries Inc.  </p>
